{"text":"And beside it, a champsosaur: a long, thin snout, built for catching fish. It made it through too. Crocodiles are cold-blooded. In this cold, they barely move. That's how they survived: they almost stop. Almost. They're slowest at dawn, before the day warms them. So you go at first light. You crawl down the bank with the bone on your back.","mood":"story","settings":{"stability":0.3,"style":0.6,"speed":1.1},"alignment":{"characters":["A","n","d"," ","b","e","s","i","d","e"," ","i","t",","," ","a"," ","c","h","a","m","p","s","o","s","a","u","r",":"," ","a"," ","l","o","n","g",","," ","t","h","i","n"," ","s","n","o","u","t",","," ","b","u","i","l","t"," ","f","o","r"," ","c","a","t","c","h","i","n","g"," ","f","i","s","h","."," ","I","t"," ","m","a","d","e"," ","i","t"," ","t","h","r","o","u","g","h"," ","t","o","o","."," ","C","r","o","c","o","d","i","l","e","s"," ","a","r","e"," ","c","o","l","d","-","b","l","o","o","d","e","d","."," ","I","n"," ","t","h","i","s"," ","c","o","l","d",","," ","t","h","e","y"," ","b","a","r","e","l","y"," ","m","o","v","e","."," ","T","h","a","t","'","s"," ","h","o","w"," ","t","h","e","y"," ","s","u","r","v","i","v","e","d",":"," ","t","h","e","y"," ","a","l","m","o","s","t"," ","s","t","o","p","."," ","A","l","m","o","s","t","."," ","T","h","e","y","'","r","e"," ","s","l","o","w","e","s","t"," ","a","t"," ","d","a","w","n",","," ","b","e","f","o","r","e"," ","t","h","e"," ","d","a","y"," ","w","a","r","m","s"," ","t","h","e","m","."," ","S","o"," ","y","o","u"," ","g","o"," ","a","t"," ","f","i","r","s","t"," ","l","i","g","h","t","."," ","Y","o","u"," ","c","r","a","w","l"," ","d","o","w","n"," ","t","h","e"," ","b","a","n","k"," ","w","i","t","h"," ","t","h","e"," ","b","o","n","e"," ","o","n"," ","y","o","u","r"," ","b","a","c","k","."],"character_start_times_seconds":[0,0.116,0.163,0.197,0.255,0.29,0.348,0.406,0.511,0.557,0.615,0.65,0.697,0.743,0.766,0.789,0.836,0.894,0.929,0.987,1.045,1.091,1.149,1.207,1.277,1.347,1.486